  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial contribution to the UN Women Trust Fund to End Violence Against Women for 2024 and 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UN Trust Fund to End Violence against Women (TF EVAW), is the only global grant-making mechanism dedicated to eradicating all forms of violence against women and girls. The Trust Fund provides grants to civil society organizations and women&apos;s rights organizations who work on ending violence against women in different contexts. The UN Trust Fund&#x2019;s focuses specifically on three thematic areas (1. Services, 2. Prevention, 3. Implementation of laws and policies) related to ending gender-based violence. 

NL is a longstanding partner of the TF EVAW. This two-year financial commitment to the UN Trust Fund to End Violence Against Women is a continuation of the previous contribution (EUR 2 mln a year for 2021-2023). The work of the Trust Fund is strongly aligned with the Netherlands&apos; development cooperation priorities related to gender equality and ending gender-based violence.</narrative>
  </description>
